---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer & Editorial Policy — CoinAINews"
  description="CoinAINews disclaimer and editorial policy. We are not financial advisors. Here's how we report."
  bodyClass="page"
  css="home-default"
  js="home-default"
  dir="ltr"
>
  <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 20px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;">
    <h1 style="font-size:36px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 24px;color:#111;">Disclaimer & Editorial Policy</h1>

    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin-bottom:20px;">
      We publish crypto and AI news. We're not your financial advisor, and nothing on this site should be treated as investment advice. This page explains exactly what that means.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 12px;color:#111;">Not financial advice</h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin-bottom:20px;">
      Crypto is volatile. Prices move fast, projects fail, and headlines can be misleading. Before making any investment decision, do your own research and consult a licensed financial advisor. What works for someone else may not work for you. We don't know your financial situation, and we're not pretending to.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 12px;color:#111;">How we report</h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin-bottom:20px;">
      Every article is written by a human and reviewed before publishing. We source claims from primary documents, on-chain data, or official statements whenever possible. When we cite an opinion, we say so. When a story develops, we update it. We don't delete articles to hide errors — we correct them and note the change.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 12px;color:#111;">No paid coverage</h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin-bottom:20px;">
      We don't accept money to write positive coverage. We don't publish sponsored articles disguised as news. If we ever publish sponsored content, it will be clearly labeled at the top, and our editorial team will have no involvement in it.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 12px;color:#111;">Corrections</h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;margin-bottom:20px;">
      We get things wrong sometimes. When we do, we fix them — quickly and transparently. If you spot an error, email us at krishnnews@gmail.com and we'll correct it. We don't bury corrections in the comments section.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 12px;color:#111;">External links</h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#444;">
      We link to external sources — news articles, research papers, official filings. We're not responsible for the content on those sites. We link to them because they're relevant, not because we endorse everything they say.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
